    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.000 Full Hd Images</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 Full Hd Videos</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40.000 Words</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music &amp; Sound effect</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moaning sfx</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Can Decide the Name Of the Character</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ren'py Engine</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional Sand Box<br><br><strong>The Game:</strong><br>Are you ready to dive into a sexy, mysterious, and laughter-filled adventure?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Monster City: A Monster College Story</i> is an adult visual novel that blends humor, the supernatural, and a touch of mischief.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the same universe as <i>Monster College</i>, this spin-off puts you in the shoes of Adam Thorne, a young vampire\u2026 just a little different from the rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Growing up with countless struggles due to his defective powers (and a complicated family), Adam is determined to carve out his own path in life. Between Alchemy lessons and Vampirology classes, he\u2019ll find himself entangled in a world of mysteries, dangers, and irresistible girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike Monster College, this time you won\u2019t be confined to <i>Silverleaf University</i>\u2014the world expands to the nearby town of Silverwood, a seemingly ordinary place\u2026 but full of secrets and hidden monsters living among humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Meet the girls of Monster City!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530770/extras/e45abc0d9e7e6701f037621d94698119.avif?t=1750862590\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udda4 <i><strong>Kassidy</strong></i> \u2013 Your alluring (and overwhelming) landlady. She\u2019ll quickly realize there\u2019s something unusual about you\u2026 but will you keep her at a distance or weave her into your web?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcaa <i><strong>Noksan</strong></i> \u2013 A strong, imposing orc with a tender heart and a sensitive soul. An outsider among her kind, and a surprise for you. Will you fall for her sweetness or her statuesque body?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2744\ufe0f <i><strong>Fuyu</strong></i> \u2013 A lively and energetic yuki-onna, in Silverleaf as part of a Japanese exchange program. The language barrier might be a challenge\u2026 but with the right approach, you\u2019ll get through to her!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f <i><strong>Lyra</strong></i> \u2013 An invisible girl who feels more like a shadow than a person. She avoids the world\u2026 but maybe you\u2019re the one who can truly \u2018see\u2019 her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530770/extras/8dd6f41afb802961a84d578af7f8c4af.avif?t=1750862590\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78 <i><strong>Beatrix</strong></i> \u2013 A sassy ghoul with a weakness for bad habits. Behind her cocky smile, there\u2019s more than meets the eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <i><strong>Elissa</strong></i> \u2013 A stunning dragoness, arrogant and self-assured, ruling over Silverleaf like a true queen bee. But behind her proud demeanor and massive ego lies a scandalous secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <i><strong>Valeria</strong></i> \u2013 A nerd with an undying passion for movies, books, and video games. This dullahan always has a wild project in mind and needs someone to lend a hand\u2026 with the right reward, of course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf19 <i><strong>Maya</strong></i> \u2013 A mysterious figure who bursts into your life without warning. Fate has tied her to you\u2026 but whether that\u2019s a blessing or a curse is up to you to decide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530770/extras/7299bad09b114c53fbaf2fcb246fc6e3.avif?t=1750862590\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And these are just some of the faces you\u2019ll meet! Old friends (and rivals) from Monster College will return, including the cheeky mummy Oliver and the captivating vampire Dragomira.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Key Features</strong></i><br>\u2728 <i>An engaging story packed with humor</i> \u2013 Sexy moments, mysteries to unravel, and hilarious banter\u2014there\u2019s never a dull moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac <i>Your choices matter</i> \u2013 Shape Adam\u2019s fate and build your relationships with unique dialogues and narrative paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <i>An expanded world</i> \u2013 Explore not just Silverleaf University, but also Silverwood, a town full of secrets and dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 <i>Immersive soundtrack</i> \u2013 Music and sound effects that enhance the atmosphere, from thrilling action to the most intimate moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <i>Breathtaking visuals</i> \u2013 Detailed illustrations, fluid animations, and an art style that brings characters and locations to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love the world of Monster College or you\u2019re looking for an adult visual novel filled with monsters, romance, and plenty of humor, Monster City is the game for you!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.000 Full Hd Images</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 Full Hd Videos</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40.000 Words</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music &amp; Sound effect</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moaning sfx</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Can Decide the Name Of the Character</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ren'py Engine</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional Sand Box<br><br><strong>The Game:</strong><br>Are you ready to dive into a sexy, mysterious, and laughter-filled adventure?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Monster City: A Monster College Story</i> is an adult visual novel that blends humor, the supernatural, and a touch of mischief.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the same universe as <i>Monster College</i>, this spin-off puts you in the shoes of Adam Thorne, a young vampire\u2026 just a little different from the rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Growing up with countless struggles due to his defective powers (and a complicated family), Adam is determined to carve out his own path in life. Between Alchemy lessons and Vampirology classes, he\u2019ll find himself entangled in a world of mysteries, dangers, and irresistible girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike Monster College, this time you won\u2019t be confined to <i>Silverleaf University</i>\u2014the world expands to the nearby town of Silverwood, a seemingly ordinary place\u2026 but full of secrets and hidden monsters living among humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Meet the girls of Monster City!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"